<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIFTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIFTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the</p>
<p>first day of the fifth test between England and Australia at</p>
<p>Trent Bridge on Thursday:</p>
<p> M.Elliott c Stewart b Headley	69</p>
<p> M.Taylor b Caddick		     76</p>
<p>G.Blewett c Stewart b B.Hollioake  50</p>
<p> M.Waugh not out			  60</p>
<p> S.Waugh not out			  38</p>
<p> Extras (lb-5 w-1 nb-3)		  9</p>
<p> Total (for 3 wickets)		 302</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-117 2-160 3-225.</p>
<p>To Bat: R.Ponting, I.Healy, S.Warne, P.Reiffel, J.Gillespie,</p>
<p>G.McGrath</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Malcolm 18-3-70-0, Headley</p>
<p>22-4-72-1, Caddick 19-4-54-1, B.Hollioake 8-1-40-1, Croft</p>
<p>16-6-37-0, A.Hollioake 7-0-24-0.</p>
<p>England - M.Atherton (captain), A.Stewart, J.Crawley,</p>
<p>N.Hussain, G.Thorpe, A.Hollioake, B.Hollioake, R.Croft,</p>
<p>A.Caddick, D.Headley, D.Malcolm.</p>
